  "raw_text": "Hunter, Dave\n\nFrom:\n\nHunter, Dave\n\nSent:\n\nWednesday, May 04, 2011 2:18 PM\n\nTo:\n\nPokorny, Camille M\n\nCc:\n\nHarper, Karen\n\nSubject:\n\nSOM Brookhaven National Laboratory (Methylphenidate)\n\nAttachments:\n\nMallinckrodt Methylphenidate research purpose letter.doc\n\nCamille,\n\nBrookhaven National Laboratory is one of ten national laboratories overseen and primarily funded by the Office of Science of the U.S. Department of Energy (DOE). I have no objection to sending bulk API to this customer; however, I do question why the letter is dated May 20, 2009.\n\nDave Hunter Mallinckrodt/Covidien Pharmaceuticals Supervisor, Controlled Substance Compliance Telephone (office) (314) 654-1310 dave.hunter@covidien.com\n\nThis information may be confidential and/or privileged. Use of this information by anyone other than the intended recipient is prohibited. If you receive this in error, please inform the sender and remove any record of this message.\n\nFrom: Pokorny, Camille M\n\nSent: Wednesday, May 04, 2011 12:31 PM\n\nTo: Hunter, Dave\n\nSubject: FW: Methylphenidate\n\nHi Dave\n\nPlease read the attached, and let me know if acceptable.\n\nThanks!\n\nCamille\n\nFrom: Genua, Michael [mailto:genua@bnl.gov]\n\nSent: Wednesday, May 04, 2011 11:46 AM\n\nTo: Pokorny, Camille M\n\nCc: Gunther, William E\n\nSubject: RE: Methylphenidate\n\nHi Camille,\n\nAttached is your official letter of research certification\n\n-Mike Genua\n\n-----Original Message-----\n\nFrom: Pokorny, Camille M [mailto:Camille.Pokorny@Covidien.com]\n\nSent: Tuesday, May 03, 2011 3:00 PM\n\nTo: Genua, Michael\n\nSubject: RE: Methylphenidate\n\nConfidential\n\n1\n\nMAL-MI 000219474 MNKOI 0003439151",
  "structured_output": {
    "markdown": "## Hunter, Dave\n\nFrom:\n\nHunter, Dave\n\nSent:\n\nWednesday, May 04, 2011 2:18 PM\n\nTo:\n\nPokorny, Camille M\n\nCc:\n\nHarper, Karen\n\nSubject:\n\nSOM Brookhaven National Laboratory (Methylphenidate)\n\nAttachments:\n\nMallinckrodt Methylphenidate research purpose letter.doc\n\nCamille,\n\nBrookhaven National Laboratory is one of ten national laboratories overseen and primarily funded by the Office of Science of the U.S. Department of Energy (DOE). I have no objection to sending bulk API to this customer; however, I do question why the letter is dated May 20, 2009.\n\nDave Hunter Mallinckrodt/Covidien Pharmaceuticals Supervisor, Controlled Substance Compliance Telephone (office) (314) 654-1310 dave.hunter@covidien.com\n\nThis information may be confidential and/or privileged. Use of this information by anyone other than the intended recipient is prohibited. If you receive this in error, please inform the sender and remove any record of this message.\n\nFrom: Pokorny, Camille M\n\nSent: Wednesday, May 04, 2011 12:31 PM\n\nTo: Hunter, Dave\n\nSubject: FW: Methylphenidate\n\nHi Dave\n\nPlease read the attached, and let me know if acceptable.\n\nThanks!\n\nCamille\n\nFrom: Genua, Michael [mailto:genua@bnl.gov]\n\nSent: Wednesday, May 04, 2011 11:46 AM\n\nTo: Pokorny, Camille M\n\nCc: Gunther, William E\n\nSubject: RE: Methylphenidate\n\nHi Camille,\n\nAttached is your official letter of research certification\n\n-Mike Genua\n\n-----Original Message-----\n\nFrom: Pokorny, Camille M [mailto:Camille.Pokorny@Covidien.com]\n\nSent: Tuesday, May 03, 2011 3:00 PM\n\nTo: Genua, Michael\n\nSubject: RE: Methylphenidate\n\nConfidential\n\n1\n\nMAL-MI 000219474 MNKOI 0003439151",
